  "question": {
    "text": "In the following circuit diagram, when $3 \\Omega$ resistor is removed, then equivalent resistance of the network\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2nFV1ykWqPDmyi63jAYi7Vzr0wuo4xhg5Sb_CY6fMsw.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
  },
